sequenceDiagram
    actor Blind User as Blind User
    participant VH as Voice Handler
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant Cam as Camera Module
    participant OCR as OCR Server
    participant Audio as Audio Engine

    Blind User-->>VH: Voice Command
    VH-->>App: Parse Command
    App-->>Cam: Activate
    Cam-->>OCR: Capture Image
    Cam-->>App: Image
    App-->>OCR: Send Frame
    OCR-->>App: Extracted Text
    App-->>OCR: Updated Step
    App-->>Audio: Send Text
    Audio-->>VH: Audio Output
    VH-->>Blind User: Listen